Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 20:11:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] alibabacloud: keep instance creation retries idempotent

Use a stable per-sandbox ECS token and deterministic tags. Preserve creation errors and reject incomplete instance responses without panicking. Reuse the request-recording test client.

Generated-by: OpenAI Codex
